    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061103.0103\n\nCAIRO, Nov. 3 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nXinhua Middle East news advisory -- Nov. 3\n\n\n\n\nThe following are some of major Mideast news stories due to be covered or pursued by Xinhua News Agency on Friday.\n\n-- Monitoring the situation in the Palestinian territories as the Israeli army launched a large-scale operation in the Gaza Strip.\n\n-- Monitoring the security situation in Iraq amid mounting violence in the country.\n\n-- Monitoring the course of formation of a Palestinian national unity government.",
